# Architecture

## Monorepo

- apps/web-shell - Host MFE
- apps/web-auth - Auth MFE
- apps/mobile - React Native
- packages/ui-web - Web components
- packages/ui-mobile - Mobile components

## Feature Structure

```
features/[name]/
├── components/
├── hooks/
├── services/
├── types/
├── [Name]Page.tsx
└── index.ts
```

## Import Rules

- Features: import from shared/ and @repo/*
- Never import between features
- Export via index.ts public API

## When to Extract

- To shared/: Used by 2+ features
- To packages/: Used by 2+ apps

## Package Naming

@repo/ui, @repo/core, @repo/types

